00:05:26.190 --> 00:05:30.030
♪ When she loved me

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:35.110
♪ When somebody loved me

00:05:35.190 --> 00:05:39.190
♪ Everything was beautiful

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:42.950
♪ Every hour we spent together

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:46.790
♪ Lives within my heart

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:53.870
♪ When she loved me ♪

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:11.550
You never forget kids
like Emily or Andy.

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:16.150
(WHISPERING) But they forget you.

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:19.910
-Jessie, I didn't know.
-Just go.

